{
    "_comment": "下单契约【建议示例】。最终以后端为准，但前端购物车提交时必须能映射到这些字段。核心：每行要能定位到具体 SKU 组合（skuKey / skuCode），价格以加购时的 SKU 单价为准。字段与 types/frontend-contract.ts 的 Order / OrderLine / ShippingAddress / OrderTotals 一致。",
    "request": {
        "items": [
            {
                "productId": "tb1",
                "skuKey": "粉色 Pink|10 mm · 10 pcs",
                "skuCode": "TB1-011",
                "qty": 3,
                "unitPrice": 2.4
            },
            {
                "productId": "e1",
                "skuKey": null,
                "qty": 1,
                "unitPrice": 59.9
            }
        ],
        "shipping": {
            "name": "Jane Doe",
            "addr": "123 Market St, Apt 4",
            "city": "San Francisco",
            "zip": "94103",
            "country": "US"
        },
        "currency": "USD"
    },
    "response": {
        "orderNo": "OS-20261022-0001",
        "status": "pending_payment",
        "items": [
            {
                "productId": "tb1",
                "skuKey": "粉色 Pink|10 mm · 10 pcs",
                "qty": 3,
                "unitPrice": 2.4
            },
            {
                "productId": "e1",
                "qty": 1,
                "unitPrice": 59.9
            }
        ],
        "totals": {
            "subtotal": 67.1,
            "shipping": 8.0,
            "tax": 5.37,
            "total": 80.47
        },
        "currency": "USD"
    },
    "_notes": [
        "skuKey / skuCode 至少给一个能唯一定位组合的标识；订单必须落到具体变体，不能只到商品级。",
        "unitPrice：下单快照价（后续商品改价不影响历史订单）。多 SKU 商品的单价来自 Sku.price。",
        "totals 由谁算（前端 vs 后端）需确认；建议后端为准，前端仅展示。",
        "金额单位：前端 money() 按『元 + 2 位小数』格式化。若后端用『分（整数）』，需在 service 层 /100。"
    ]
}